s Black Basta August 2022", "url": "https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/threat-assessment-black-basta-ransomware"}, {"description": "Gonzalez, I., Chavez I., et al. (2022, May 9). Examining the Black Basta Ransomware’s Infection Routine. Retrieved March 7, 2023.", "source_name": "Trend Micro Black Basta May 2022", "url": "https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/22/e/examining-the-black-basta-ransomwares-infection-routine.html"}, {"description": "Inman, R. and Gurney, P. (2022, June 6). Shining the Light on Black Basta. Retrieved March 8, 2023.", "source_name": "NCC Group Black Basta June 2022", "url": "https://research.nccgroup.com/2022/06/06/shining-the-light-on-black-basta/"}, {"description": "Vilkomir-Preisman, S. (2022, August 18). Beating Black Basta Ransomware. Retrieved March 8, 2023.", "source_name": "Deep Instinct Black Basta August 2022", "url": "https://www.deepinstinct.com/blog/black-basta-ransomware-threat-emergence"}, {"description": "Zargarov, N. (2022, May 2). New Black Basta Ransomware Hijacks Windows Fax Service. Retrieved March 7, 2023.", "source_name": "Minerva Labs Black Basta May 2022", "url": "https://minerva-labs.com/blog/new-black-basta-ransomware-hijacks-windows-fax-service/"}], "id": "relationship--314719c9-a946-4630-a09c-d416b48f4c21", "modified": "2026-04-29T14:23:05.980Z", "object_marking_refs": ["marking-definition--fa42a846-8d90-4e51-bc29-71d5b4802168"], "relationship_type": "uses", "revoked": false, "source_ref": "malware--8d242fb4-9033-4f13-8a88-4b9b4bcd9a53", "spec_version": "2.1", "target_ref": "attack-pattern--8c41090b-aa47-4331-986b-8c9a51a91103", "type": "relationship", "x_mitre_attack_spec_version": "3.3.0", "x_mitre_deprecated": false, "x_mitre_modified_by_ref": "identity--c78cb6e5-0c4b-4611-8297-d1b8b55e40b5"}', 'kb-doc-09-mitre-attack-p0-19126', 0, 328, '09-mitre-attack', 'retrieved', '04C74885D67BC8AB1CF90AE676E06BA1EF4F875B48AE2BF2172BCEBF373D045B', 'v1', '{"source_id": "09-mitre-attack", "version": "retrieved", "corpus